\subsection{Method \code{expected_improvement()}}{
Compute the Expected Improvement acquisition function.
For minimisation: EI(x) = (y_best - mu) * Phi(z) + sigma * phi(z)
where z = (y_best - mu) / sigma.
\subsection{Usage}{
\if{html}{\out{<div class="r">}}\preformatted{BayesianOptimizer$expected_improvement(X_new, y_best)}\if{html}{\out{</div>}}
}

